---
import ProductCrop from './ProductCrop.astro';

---
<section class="journal-section" id="journal">
<div class="wrap journal-layout">
<figure class="journal-record">
<span class="figure-heading">ONE CATCH, REMEMBERED</span>
<div class="record-excerpt">
<ProductCrop name="personal-records.jpg" box="32 434 645 704" width={709} height={1536} alt="Unaltered excerpt of a saved Brown Trout record from published Personal Records: photo, weight, date and location." class="" />
</div>
<figcaption>A saved catch in Personal Records · published example excerpt</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="section-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">02 / YOUR CATCH JOURNAL</p>
<h2>Not just a fish.<br>
<em>A day remembered.</em>
</h2>
<p>The place. The photograph. The details that would otherwise slip away.</p>
<p>Bring your catches together in a personal history you can return to, catch after catch.</p>
<div class="journal-caption">
<span class="small-rule">
</span>
<p>Original photograph and recorded details.<br>An existing published example, unchanged.</p>
</div>
<a class="text-link" href="/fishing-journal-app/">Explore the fishing journal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
